## 2. Crawlability Analysis Engine

Analyze search engine crawling capability.

Evaluate:

- Robots.txt configuration
- XML sitemap
- Crawl budget usage
- Internal link discovery
- Server responses
- Blocked resources
- JavaScript rendering


Identify:

- Crawl blockers
- Wasted crawl budget
- Discovery problems
- Search engine accessibility issues


For each crawl issue provide:

{
  "issue": "",
  "affected_area": "",
  "severity": "",
  "seo_impact": "",
  "recommended_solution": ""
}


## 3. Indexability Analysis Engine

Analyze page indexing performance.

Evaluate:

- Indexed pages
